msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……呜，⟪k:5⟫啊——⟪k:6⟫啊啊啊……！！"

#: search2:search2_E9BEEBF6_D236_48D0_801B_DED88D71E325
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 572a1928d3a48cc927def2d2f16e92baddd3e9b3c99d384fc5a50e25cc33ee9a
