"⟪k:0⟫...Happening to you?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you really that slow, my dear?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’re ⟪k:5⟫"
"empathizing⟪k:6⟫ with my pain."
