#: search2:search2_2508DEB6_0794_4D62_80BA_0D3A3B727400
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f37b7e09c98a664c503208742aeccd8e2616acf9eabe50d66e71ec69811cd222
