#: search2:search2_6999942E_AAE4_4D7C_909A_3E4F7AAA4F20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f62bab1318e7028fb69c0b1357c76f33010a423ea324fd5984639b633cf3400f
#. default-sha256: ea2b9b0496baefa1504a94be6f929203f7e8fba52196756371bc89ed4aebae33
msgctxt "search2:search2_6999942E_AAE4_4D7C_909A_3E4F7AAA4F20"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was at a complete loss for some time after that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I didn’t want to "
"return to the city, because I knew there was no one left who would take me in. ⟪k:5⟫There was "
"only the lord, who had bound me and drained me of my blood.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫So I wandered the "
"roads, no destination in mind and nothing to defend myself but the clothes on my back. ⟪k:9⟫"
"Frankly, I’m rather surprised I wasn’t attacked by bandits.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫After walking "
"for days without food or water, my mind was hazy and my exhaustion at a peak.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫In "
"the distance, I saw a lake. ⟪k:17⟫So driven by my thirst, I turned my unsteady feet toward the "
"water—not caring that it took me off the main road.⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫And it turned out that "
"was the correct choice, because there was a small cottage beside the lake, ⟪k:22⟫smoke rising "
"from the chimney, telling me it wasn’t abandoned. ⟪k:23⟫Out of sheer desperation, I knocked on "
"the door."
msgstr ""
"　那之后——我就无依无靠了。⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫　我没想过要回到镇上。⟪k:2⟫在那里，已经没有人会收留我了。⟪k:3⟫"
"有的只有想抽我血的领主。⟪k:4⟫我一个人漫无目的地在路上彷徨。⟪k:5⟫我没有任何防备，途中没有被盗贼袭"
"击，简直是不可思议。⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　我不吃不喝地持续行走，就在疲劳达到极限，意识变得模糊的时候。"
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　在远处看见了湖。⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　我口很渴，摇摇晃晃地朝那边走了过去。⟪k:13⟫虽然走到那边"
"就远离了大路，但事已至此，我已经什么都不在意了。⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　那个选择是幸运的。⟪k:16⟫在湖畔的附"
"近，有一座小屋。⟪k:17⟫烟囱冒出的热气，说明这不是一间废屋。⟪k:18⟫我把它当成救命稻草，敲了敲门。"

#: search2:search2_661AD98A_B868_45A4_9294_8391281B9EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2bf369e91cb456a8d7802b9864fecd6b81e2028930dbd9bf8cf07cde787d0ea
#. default-sha256: 12a233c1a70cf4b291a93a388df4879e901fa00f00fed797aee13e966cf3b19f
msgctxt "search2:search2_661AD98A_B868_45A4_9294_8391281B9EE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No one answered.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The door wasn’t locked, so I slowly, hesitantly pushed "
"it open.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫And beyond it, I found an old woman, sitting dead in a chair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　但是并没有人回答。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　门也没有上锁。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　我有些迟疑——小心翼翼地推开了门。"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　里面有一个已经死去的老妇人。"

#: search2:search2_8C228291_98E0_45C7_9088_92594B70465F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61b895cb0a577712a6c2b2ddb988854709bf6f4b5fdbea154581b21eb3fa3c7d
#. default-sha256: deeeaf8266387e3df66cb8ae59c4e2696a4aa5d058be76df0a31920e16d2b20c
msgctxt "search2:search2_8C228291_98E0_45C7_9088_92594B70465F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dragging the woman’s body by her feet, I dumped her into the lake.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Do you "
"think doing so makes me a bad person—makes me unsaintly?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Well, I didn’t have "
"anywhere else to go, and the owner of the cozy cottage was no longer of this world. ⟪k:8⟫There "
"was no reason I couldn’t fill the home in her stead, was there?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I deserved to "
"have somewhere I felt comfortable, after everything I’d been through, didn’t I?⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫And so, I took up residence in the old witch’s cottage—⟪k:16⟫and remained there until my "
"sixteenth year."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　我把老妇人的尸体拖出来，扔进了湖畔里。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　你会责备我的行为很邪恶吗？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　但"
"是，我已经无处可去了。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　这间有着暖炉的温暖小屋，它的主人已经断气。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　既然如此，"
"我接替她住下，也没有任何问题吧？⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　给自己营造安宁的场所……⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　不也没有关系了"
"吗？⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　于是，我代替老妇人，作为魔女，在这个小屋住下。⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　——直到我迎来十"
"六岁为止。"

#: search2:search2_5E78B70B_A44C_4368_A4F1_02CCFAA545DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94b7719ab33a7849b33abb0c7beeda59005a4cd85e4c5ba28531db271233b462
#. default-sha256: 2f4cbddfac5f4afb0266b63212870d6645b8aca96f1be4f901f54858d3ccdecb
msgctxt "search2:search2_5E78B70B_A44C_4368_A4F1_02CCFAA545DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫By sixteen, a terrible cynicism had taken root in my heart. ⟪k:2⟫I had no trust for "
"people. ⟪k:3⟫I shut them out, building high walls around myself. ⟪k:4⟫After such a tumultuous, "
"bloody childhood, it was all I could do to protect myself—to keep my young spirit from cracking."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Nevertheless, travelers would, on occasion, pay the old witch’s cottage a visit, "
"seeking her medicines. ⟪k:8⟫Whenever someone arrived,⟪k:9⟫I would cautiously crack the door open, "
"telling them they could trade for whatever they wanted with food, and never showing my face.⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫One day, a young man showed up at the cottage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　成长到十六的我，变得非常厌世。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　我不相信人类，躲在自己的壳里闭门不出。⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫　我经历过动荡的幼年时代、亲眼见过对年幼的孩子来说无法承受的死亡，只能通过切断和别人的联系来"
"保持自我。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　但是，偶尔会有人从远方来寻求魔女的药草。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　在这种时候，我都会非常警"
"惕，只从门内把药给他们，绝不露脸。作为报酬，我会获得食物。⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　某一天。⟪k:12⟫一位十"
"分年轻的青年，造访了小屋。"

#: search2:search2_721E3BCC_9985_4E7D_8264_852559F930F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 397bb232029a609af8aae8c59f3ca7f5a8d041fe0e823595360142d86e1fa3df
#. default-sha256: cb2c869606f584d1eda5399a12d5549de396f702dfe5b7b297a29b159449ca7b
msgctxt "search2:search2_721E3BCC_9985_4E7D_8264_852559F930F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He was very soft-spoken—⟪k:2⟫there was a distinct kindness in his voice, which I "
"thought unusual. Curious. ⟪k:3⟫What kind of person could he be? ⟪k:4⟫What did he look like? What "
"expressions did he make as he spoke?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫To satisfy that curiosity, I snuck a peek at "
"him through the crack in the door.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫He was a handsome young man with flowing "
"flaxen hair. ⟪k:12⟫And upon seeing me, he didn’t flinch back in disgust. ⟪k:13⟫He smiled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　他的声音非常轻柔、温和。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　我对他十分在意。⟪k:3⟫拥有这般温柔声音的青年，到底是什么"
"样的人呢？⟪k:4⟫他有着怎样的容貌，又用怎样的表情说话呢。⟪k:5⟫我从门的缝隙，悄悄地偷看了他。⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　那是个有着亚麻色头发的青年。⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　他即便看见我丑陋的脸，也没有表示厌恶，而是对"
"我微笑了。"

#: search2:search2_8E634A16_A4BE_4A9B_8AB1_60C8630CE626
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4b94967c734278902d4c5300249c75af1a0574040da5bfb99ff17f42676bed9
#. default-sha256: c098ae84d3d911a283076742b602c058becc9e40ca9984d11658a89311254c05
msgctxt "search2:search2_8E634A16_A4BE_4A9B_8AB1_60C8630CE626"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That word, muttered beneath his breath, sparked my memory.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I was a saint."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫My blood had healing properties.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I had no reason to hesitate.⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Someone needed my help, and who deserved it more than this kindhearted young man’s "
"sister?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫So I decided to tell him what I really was. ⟪k:17⟫That my blood had "
"miraculous powers—that it had saved people. ⟪k:18⟫That the moment I had been born, the drought "
"plaguing my village had come to an end. ⟪k:19⟫That I had been known as a saint—the daughter of "
"God.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫I told him everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　他的喃喃自语——⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　让我想起了……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　自己曾是圣女。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　还想起了——我的"
"血可以净化病痛。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　那时候，我没有犹豫。⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　不需要犹豫。⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　现在正该用"
"我的力量，去救助受苦难的人。⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　就该为他这样温柔的人使用力量。⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　下定决心后，"
"我说了出自己的真实身份。⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫　也说了我的血曾拯救过人们、创造了奇迹的事——⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫　我出"
"生时降下大雨拯救了村子的事——⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫　然后被称为圣女的事。⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫　我把一切都告诉了他。"

#: search2:search2_4C2F47EA_0EB8_438B_BEA0_C0B0D2250A74
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cdb89d0f26e17e69a4f454d6f6d8240c7c9f4afd30c551ecd542ca55ed7c645
#. default-sha256: 50cd40af85097db0b3cbeb0627f7300ac43d7762158e0a3ece90059badc4e549
msgctxt "search2:search2_4C2F47EA_0EB8_438B_BEA0_C0B0D2250A74"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Neither of them had any doubts about my sainthood. ⟪k:2⟫And because they believed, a "
"miracle occurred.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The flaxen-haired girl recovered enough to get out of her bed."
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I was extremely proud of myself. ⟪k:9⟫I felt like, for once, I had ⟪k:10⟫"
"actually⟪k:11⟫ saved someone’s life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　亚麻色头发的青年和少女，对自称圣女的我，毫不怀疑。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　所以，再次——发生了奇迹。⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫　少女的病情好转，能从床上起来了。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　那个时候，我非常自豪。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　我终于，在真"
"正的意义上拯救了他人……"

#: search2:search2_C9949666_80B0_4738_8347_37314F7B3142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b119876445c273fe1328c5130b964c7cd25f7eb38581b5aff60569ce4f16035
#. default-sha256: 3e67e61ce5081abba0b6ba226b18687de3542b2e6e41313a0f74fa0ac79f0b7f
msgctxt "search2:search2_C9949666_80B0_4738_8347_37314F7B3142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The only issue was... she didn’t make a ⟪k:2⟫complete⟪k:3⟫ recovery. ⟪k:4⟫For a few "
"days after drinking my blood, she was in good health, but her condition quickly regressed.⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I was deeply perplexed by this. ⟪k:8⟫A miracle ⟪k:9⟫had⟪k:10⟫ undoubtedly taken place, "
"but it was only temporary.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Now, though, I believe I can explain what happened."
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫Her “recovery” was nothing more than a placebo effect caused by her faith."
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫But that’s something I couldn’t have known at the time. ⟪k:22⟫We were all "
"three perplexed—and we were all three disheartened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　——然而，少女的病并非痊愈了。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　喝下我的血后，病情确实有所好转，但是没几天就回到原"
"状了。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　当时的我感到很不可思议。⟪k:5⟫奇迹应该已经发生了，不知为何没有持续下去。⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫　但现在的话——我想我知道其中的理由。⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　没错，那只是因为相信有药效，而产生的心"
"理安慰罢了。⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　我到现如今才明白此事。但在当时，包括我在内，大家都觉得很诧异——并且"
"很失望。"

#: search2:search2_9EC83FDB_B6F9_451B_87F3_19C5CE993A91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf1840bda82ab7025c00456f7643f10f537b7998511755df43dc93108fd0d8fb
#. default-sha256: 79300b213ad8044b767509a7acbfe8ddf46fa68badf83e669d6f1b2dcc4ae569
msgctxt "search2:search2_9EC83FDB_B6F9_451B_87F3_19C5CE993A91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I told the man he had to leave. ⟪k:2⟫That I would not be opening the door for any "
"reason.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫In response, he said,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫　我让他赶快离开。⟪k:1⟫坚决地告诉他，我绝对不会开门的。⟪k:2⟫然而门对面的男人却说——"

#: search2:search2_D971AEF5_2313_4E85_8E48_D798F1DF075A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25ba5900e8cd07eb257c3a9e19b927906b5f9bfdf780f369e8b9872bd2bf5701
#. default-sha256: 9941dcd4cd99cc103246f7cf6d925f344a2a5063870737f825772db153e4eec8
msgctxt "search2:search2_D971AEF5_2313_4E85_8E48_D798F1DF075A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I am in need of your blood.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Could you not spare a little?”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「我需要你的血。你能分给我吗？」"

#: search2:search2_45DC4392_FB6D_43F6_8000_72DDF77FF12B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5606630a9f1568372e8d6f99e206e1ed7be6f1fe970205964a453cf43a075c97
#. default-sha256: ec061669e2effde91825214ff51aadc91dac42086d3106c3a768a324e5fa2c14
msgctxt "search2:search2_45DC4392_FB6D_43F6_8000_72DDF77FF12B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“I want to talk to you too...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「我也想跟你说话」"

#: search2:search2_6E9F9618_223E_4670_B313_8AA7D8EDC3DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11f8486e3b34dfffe365c5fe379a8bb4600510de04988c45398e1f710d53dfb4
#. default-sha256: 5755f3df9ed8374cae6f9b5c01ec9cd1f25bc20e1e861bab67381f15987a3f56
msgctxt "search2:search2_6E9F9618_223E_4670_B313_8AA7D8EDC3DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I was in a daze.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫I couldn’t make sense of anything."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I didn’t ⟪k:13⟫want⟪k:14⟫ to."
msgstr ""
"　⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　我什么也……⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　不知道了。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　也不想去知道……"

#: search2:search2_153578CF_F806_40F0_8C8F_4304193CEE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9847f98522ade6014cfb2b1ef7fdb0bb348eaccd65275a686c0c32bf79e778e4
#. default-sha256: 26c02d89350a7a58adf0bf1646e206f55e1e0c384c25bec0e2018fc944bf6ba4
msgctxt "search2:search2_153578CF_F806_40F0_8C8F_4304193CEE91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My left arm fell to the floor before I even knew what was happening, and then my legs "
"gave out.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The pain, searing and unbearable, came a few moments later, as I was "
"lying in an ever-expanding pool of my own blood.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I did something then that I hadn’t "
"done before—⟪k:8⟫that I had resisted doing no matter how much blood the lord had stolen from me."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫I screamed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　……突然失去了左臂的我，连站都站不起来。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　沉进自己流下的血海时，难以忍受的剧痛向我"
"袭来——⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　我发出嘶声力竭的惨叫。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　在领主取走我的血的时候，我都从未喊叫过。⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫　在这一刻，我第一次觉得。"

#: search2:search2_2AA368F9_ADDD_4DE1_92BF_83577652A094
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93472c510dead0da9b1a9b1f0909e3558ef72bb8307d3c9fd06e32310915d2a9
#. default-sha256: 42e1cf02faf61c81d7d10ee4806d4098d092c26e5528de5237fbde40e27f7cfe
msgctxt "search2:search2_2AA368F9_ADDD_4DE1_92BF_83577652A094"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“That’s your share. Should last you long enough.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「有了这些，暂时就没问题了吧。这是你的那一份」"

#: search2:search2_C8BAAB1A_B0E2_4471_90E5_47E40ADA5C5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0772da3ba657c82f0f652c1c8c639a4225be14faa18996724d33422fd6cd9bc8
#. default-sha256: 53e88cc3ca2282bdc010b3ab203deed838f38a849832b02e7d843594230919d5
msgctxt "search2:search2_C8BAAB1A_B0E2_4471_90E5_47E40ADA5C5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Don’t take it personally?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Tell me, is there ⟪k:7⟫anyone⟪k:8⟫ in "
"this world who ⟪k:9⟫wouldn’t⟪k:10⟫ feel a bit of spite after being put through such torture?⟪k:11⟫"
"⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫How was I supposed to let that slide?⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫No one’s ⟪k:17⟫that⟪k:18⟫ much "
"of a saint.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫My trust had been betrayed, and I was supposed to turn the other "
"cheek?⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫A man had barged into my home uninvited and cut off my arm, and I was "
"supposed to smile and take it?⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Is there anyone, anywhere, who doesn’t feel even "
"the slightest bit of hatred ever?⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Is there anyone in this world who could just "
"laugh and brush off this level of abuse?⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫Tell me, is there?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　别怪我？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　真好笑，谁能不痛恨这样伤害自己的人？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　你要我如何能不恨你？"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　有这种圣人吗？⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　给予信任却被背叛，会有人原谅吗？⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫　被不请自来的男"
"人切下手腕，会有人不流泪吗？⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　遭遇此等惨剧，会有人不憎恨这个世界吗？⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　遭遇"
"此等惨剧，还有人能笑着说「希望我能帮上忙」吗？⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　请告诉我。"

#: search2:search2_7994CF70_8B72_470E_ADB2_7A32EAF74B34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11d7c7ff69df938000e53126417f56a960f538f7c82cd38b005b8f96b6a2804e
#. default-sha256: 7847f2fcfcca9dfaef60b5a0fe7cdf7962c97eaac01bef3c821b1bcf483aa414
msgctxt "search2:search2_7994CF70_8B72_470E_ADB2_7A32EAF74B34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“So the lord made me an offer:”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「领主告诉我——」"

#: search2:search2_882D7805_A53B_4B83_B0E8_DEB128D83AD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36be9ca279af1486ae441f56ce6e435e026b6765dae8aa2b12416a7b902feb94
#. default-sha256: e5e839db5d9e58c5239a48dbc751135c520b36822bd14e917a30fc49d635e173
msgctxt "search2:search2_882D7805_A53B_4B83_B0E8_DEB128D83AD6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The lord?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Why him again?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Why couldn’t he leave me alone?"
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫After trying to kill me during one of his blood sabbats, why was he after my "
"blood once more?⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Had he learned it really did have miraculous powers and decided "
"he wanted me back?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　领主？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　为什么，领主又出现了？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　为什么，还不肯放过我？⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　举办"
"血之飨宴，还要杀我，为什么现在又来要我的血？⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　知道我的奇迹是真的——想再一次得到手吗？"

#: search2:search2_009BAF82_3397_4AF3_979E_89EE9F284943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae373c9d0041af505d62ef00edb13360906cf2e663582f54b9023175bcee510a
#. default-sha256: a3e2babd27ace2cf616d7b9069dc7fb416e1547fa8052d7222fa3b87531e40f1
msgctxt "search2:search2_009BAF82_3397_4AF3_979E_89EE9F284943"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“You get to be the sacrifice...”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「为了那家伙的教会……为了守护那家伙的世界……」"

#: search2:search2_60680B7F_61CE_4E68_B15B_7CE93D5B6B00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 077436412eab351dc78b6eef54a6e0861b7687deae734e768abe7d94d444064e
#. default-sha256: 7ec667cece50251ab9abb1748feeaab349baa0fd0e0d8f4b1d862d99f24261d4
msgctxt "search2:search2_60680B7F_61CE_4E68_B15B_7CE93D5B6B00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sacrifice?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Excuse me, ⟪k:5⟫what⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫And what’s all this "
"about “keeping her church from collapsing”?⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫You ⟪k:13⟫murdered⟪k:14⟫ a carriage "
"full of innocent people. ⟪k:15⟫And you’re trying to protect a church? ⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫You?⟪k:18⟫ "
"⟪k:19⟫Are you out of your mind?⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫Churches are where people go to commune with "
"God. ⟪k:23⟫To speak with ⟪k:24⟫my Father⟪k:25⟫!⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫How ⟪k:29⟫dare⟪k:30⟫ you soil "
"those sanctified grounds with your filthy hands, you beast! ⟪k:31⟫It’s insulting. Sacrilegious. "
"Repulsive. ⟪k:32⟫Just what do you think we are?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　牺牲？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　这是什么意思。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　话说回来，刚才你一直「保护」、「保护」的，说什"
"么呢？⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　你之前不是还屠杀了无辜的奴隶们吗？⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　做出那种事的男人，要保护教会？"
"⟪k:9⟫别说傻话了。⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　教会是与神明交流的地方。⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　是我与天父交流的地方啊！"
"⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　为什么这种神圣的场所，会被你这种野兽污染！⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫　你是要……羞辱我的天父……羞辱我"
"吗？⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫　你把我们当什么了……！"

#: search2:search2_22B3A6A2_EE2C_445D_A155_66FC9E7653BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aabdc3e51214b1a001538e406d5758ea98e250a0205e96d7797269962d882613
#. default-sha256: e1cf542027c8b98b87eb258e6d4af7e7bd4215ce0f3a0c7689c23ec23c002e1c
msgctxt "search2:search2_22B3A6A2_EE2C_445D_A155_66FC9E7653BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“So don’t take it personally, witch.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「不要怪罪我，魔女……」"

#: search2:search2_6B3EE901_C92B_4091_B63E_750AE2051278
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea6a771268071adac3ca585fd1dc9545add9c4cf4474e346b4b032011da95b1a
#. default-sha256: e0296d7f9eb5e3e811a959547a7956178fa8a0966ce18979c0af701391127ffc
msgctxt "search2:search2_6B3EE901_C92B_4091_B63E_750AE2051278"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I’m...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I’m not a witch...⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫I’m a saint...⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫I was a saint...⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫My blood exists to do the "
"Lord’s work...⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫not to satisfy the avarice of men..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　我，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　我，⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　我……⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　我不是魔女……⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　我曾是圣女……⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫　我曾经是圣女啊……⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　我的血可是神圣之物……⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　不该为了他人的欲望利用………"

#: search2:search2_6CAB4BFA_FDA1_4C75_A07B_143A48FADEB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b29496934fc4367b9bc70e2ed2bd0ae6d068e734954f825b23aa549c590cb702
#. default-sha256: f205208a35dc73193021fca0cacc05a2b1925b4079c02f6e944cda7d7152bbaf
msgctxt "search2:search2_6CAB4BFA_FDA1_4C75_A07B_143A48FADEB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is this⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫happening to me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫　你说，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　为什么，⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　会变成这样呢？"

#: search2:search2_CD4388F1_5987_4EF6_BDF1_30658B184D72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8364e14978b04ccb4428a925f86bfd7f285f777244842d99e280781daf78c91a
#. default-sha256: 8e1584a63b80ebcf10d1d50900c9427b63ab7652535c83ee3175d7d6d18b1384
msgctxt "search2:search2_CD4388F1_5987_4EF6_BDF1_30658B184D72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The man brought me back to the city.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫But "
"instead of taking me to the lord’s manor, he brought me to a church on the city’s outskirts. ⟪k:8⟫"
"Though, to be honest, it looked more like an estate than a church.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The church "
"also served as a hospital, offering free care to less fortunate children, the poor, and the "
"infirm.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫That was when I learned why he had said they needed money. ⟪k:16⟫"
"The owner of the church offered unconditional assistance to anyone who came. ⟪k:17⟫Even when food "
"and supplies ran low, they would ration their own in order to keep helping others. ⟪k:18⟫As a "
"result, the church was perpetually on the verge of collapse.⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫The church was run "
"by a woman—something exceedingly rare for the time. ⟪k:22⟫There were no priests; all management "
"was handled by a single nun, who everyone referred to..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　…………⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　男人把我带回了那片领地。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　并没有去领主的府邸，而是把我带到郊外偏"
"僻处的教堂。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　只是，那里……与其说是教会，不如说是一座宅院。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫　看起来，那教堂也是"
"一家医院。⟪k:9⟫那里经常会施舍孤儿、穷人和病人。⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　这个时候，我明白了缺钱的意思。"
"⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫　教会的主人，似乎在不加节制地施舍。⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫　就算教会的资金和食品都见底了，也削减"
"自己的粮食救济他人。⟪k:17⟫所以，教会眼看着无法续存了。⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫　这个教会的主人，是一位女性。"
"⟪k:20⟫真是少见。⟪k:21⟫没有神父，修女一个人照料着整个教会。⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫　大家都称那个修女为——"

#: search2:search2_544B2421_BBDA_4996_82EA_944EC02CE0C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 404cca13b83542679953015dd02ac3519501226f367938a38eb8fbf1668acfbd
#. default-sha256: 15f4849b2058840b8c0f4dd9a5299051c22d4c9b952535fab2f2c269665d8c44
msgctxt "search2:search2_544B2421_BBDA_4996_82EA_944EC02CE0C7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as the “Saintess.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫圣女……"

#: search2:search2_43C0B809_21F1_4499_8377_5F0F8329F9E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 167cb5eb1c09de1d65e8b82c3bc394b60b9ff7b11c900dd6e5dc75b09f61971d
#. default-sha256: 3677c56034ef436d8821447cc3200b3b1604c69748ecfb6ee918068ad3758e18
msgctxt "search2:search2_43C0B809_21F1_4499_8377_5F0F8329F9E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I remained imprisoned for a long, long time.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In the beginning, the "
"swordsman guarded me, ⟪k:5⟫though before long, the flaxen-haired young man showed up as well. "
"⟪k:6⟫Presumably one severed arm wasn’t enough to keep his sister healthy for long.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫In listening to their conversations, I learned that, to ensure no one else could get in, "
"the observation tower was sealed with three locks. ⟪k:11⟫The lord, the swordsman, and the young "
"man each held one of the keys. ⟪k:12⟫I was their secret, locked away in the tower for them to "
"drain of blood away from wandering eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　……幽禁持续了很久。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　最初，是那个男人监视着我。⟪k:3⟫但是很快，亚麻发色的青年也加入"
"了。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　只靠我的一只手……应该不够持续治疗他的妹妹吧？⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫　据他们所说，领"
"主、男人、青年，各自拿着一把钥匙。⟪k:10⟫为了不让瞭望塔被轻易打开，钥匙分成了三把。⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫　教"
"会的瞭望塔上关着魔女——⟪k:13⟫为了不让世人知晓，三人将其作为秘密，继续幽禁着我，不断抽走我的血。"

#: search2:search2_CBA47237_0B57_42B9_99C6_0556D4C38363
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 64b3c2e6fa34322198e400f1a5f21281fe2ed3066a21aa0f4fdc6018bb3ae065
#. default-sha256: c3726cc694d817493e3474efd31ef5db15781eac54f55f3fc5381cfa68d54bc1
msgctxt "search2:search2_CBA47237_0B57_42B9_99C6_0556D4C38363"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I heard the flaxen-haired girl’s voice, who had regained her health drinking my blood."
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I heard her brother’s voice, who had betrayed me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I heard the nun’s "
"voice, who played saint in my stead.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫I heard the barbaric swordsman’s voice, who "
"had chopped off my arm.⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫And I heard the lord’s voice—the root of all my "
"suffering."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫　用我的血恢复健康的，亚麻发色少女的声音。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　曾经很温柔、却背叛了我的，那个哥哥的声"
"音。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫　代替我被称为圣女的，修女的声音。⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫　切断我的左臂的，残忍男人的声音。⟪k:7⟫"
"⟪k:8⟫　还有——一切的的罪魁祸首，领主的声音。"

#: search2:search2_E3E54520_F6D0_4C2E_B309_B045ECD0DCCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b45555babddc954c78d552efd4bf0ee5aab60bc1878b3510d43719d7c099c7f
#. default-sha256: a583f5ff2cdea67d3a1cd2dea38a15d3bafb42175c7b619a826186c5df974c7e
msgctxt "search2:search2_E3E54520_F6D0_4C2E_B309_B045ECD0DCCD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And at noon on the day of the festival, the church bell tolled."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫　庆典当天，正午时分，报时的钟声响了起来。"

#: search2:search2_71A64AA3_87CD_4703_A77E_CEA6A021902C
