msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫One,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫two,⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫three,⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫four,⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"⟪k:14⟫five,⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫six,⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫seven,⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫eight,⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫"
"⟪k:26⟫nine,⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫ten,⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫eleven,⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫and with the "
"twelfth chime,⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫I died."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫一⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫二⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫三⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫四⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫五⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫六⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫七⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫八⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫九⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫十"
"⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫十一⟪k:33⟫⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫第十二下钟声响起的瞬间——⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫我断绝了呼"
"吸。"

#: search2:search2_4EBFF23F_70C2_4F56_BA17_9588D0C70580
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db761ca1b04ba4b9fd9411a4042d3047f84187112e39a996f4131fbece0e446e
#. default-sha256: 40855c0339c74f8a25e910432631b2cbd741377327f80d1aa2b3b3fadbb7c16e
msgctxt "search2:search2_4EBFF23F_70C2_4F56_BA17_9588D0C70580"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫As the bell’s last pealing faded into silence, the tower door "
"swung open. ⟪k:7⟫Standing on the other side of it were the three men. ⟪k:8⟫They must have wanted "
"to drain a little more from me to use in the feast, ⟪k:9⟫but they arrived at the worst possible "
"moment.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫The flaxen-haired young man was the first to express his consternation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫　在钟声响毕……恢复宁静的时候。⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫　瞭望塔的门被打开了。⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫　三个男人出现在门口。⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫　不知是不是想分给我宴会上的食物——⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫　他们在最糟"
"的时候现身了。⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫　亚麻发色的青年最先慌乱起来。"

#: search2:search2_C3C31414_3C27_45F6_A85E_DC497DD51F33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 217139b4ea9b7f535c363dd17dc9081bbcb83b3813e5954fde65249a47ed6f69
